Package: libilbc0
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: iLBC audio codec library (classic API)
 Shared library for the classic iLBC audio codec API as used by
 FreeSWITCH mod_ilbc, rebuilt for Debian Buster from the source
 previously carried in-tree by FreeSWITCH.

Package: libilbc-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libilbc0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: iLBC audio codec library (development files)
 Headers, pkg-config file and development files for the classic
 iLBC audio codec API, rebuilt for Debian Buster.
